      "created_at": "2018-02-04T10:29:48Z",
      "updated_at": "2018-02-04T11:40:57Z",
      "body": "This API got removed in Firefox, and in WebKit (Safari). Right now [only Chrome supports it](https://caniuse.com/#feat=battery-status) which probably isn't enough to justify the effort, so I'll close this.\r\n\r\nNB: it got removed because there were concerns of breach of privacy, the battery status being an easy way to fingerprint users.\r\n\r\nTo achieve a similar-ish outcome we could work towards having some auto-save feature, like suggested for #2199, #995.",
